    en: `Founder & AI / Full-Stack Engineer - EMM
March 2026 – Present · France

Independent software engineering practice: web apps, SaaS and AI automation for founders, SMEs and agencies. What I offer: self-hosted AI agents with custom skills and MCP, rescue of apps built with AI app builders or coding agents (Lovable, Bolt, Cursor, Claude Code), and LLM features inside existing products.

• AI browser automation with jev, Browser Use's browser agent: my own task runner, in use since October 2026, drives dedicated browsers from the terminal to enter, extract and update data in back-offices that have no API. It hands over to a human for logins, captchas and 2FA, and logs every step with a screenshot and its cost.
• My own agent harness, versioned and shared across my machines: hooks that turn a correction I keep repeating into an automatic check, scheduled routines that alert me when they fail, and a 180B mixture-of-experts model (about 6B active per token) on an RTX 3080 20 GB. A router hook I wrote raised the share of needed skills that load from 57% to 84% on held-out prompts. Tour: https://moubarak.dev/harness

Stack: TypeScript · Python · Next.js · Node.js · Supabase · Docker · OpenAI, Claude, Gemini APIs · MCP · Browser Use · Claude Code

Skills: AI Agents · Artificial Intelligence (AI) · Automation · Large Language Models (LLM) · Software Architecture · Full-Stack Development · Software as a Service (SaaS) · Web Development`,
